    "name": "Endless Invader",
    "steam_appid": 3692930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/809859f1535b3207e0e17c71c6fc38df.avif?t=1753213229\" width=720 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/6bc4a1af656c72224f1c3151cf50134c.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/6bc4a1af656c72224f1c3151cf50134c.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orbit Assault Action Defense Game, <i>Endless Invader!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Invader</strong> is the Orbit Assault Action Defense game where you must fend off enemies pouring in from all directions and protect your planet until the very end. <br>Hold the line with strategy, chaos, and persistence\u2014defeat the final invader and claim your victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/08996978cd1a48da7b59773ecd93454f.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/08996978cd1a48da7b59773ecd93454f.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the planet's guardian and stop the invaders from consuming it.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remote planet <strong>Aevinculum</strong> breathes with life thanks to the mysterious energy flowing from its core\u2014<strong>Terravitalitic Force</strong>. <br>One day, enemies known as the <strong>Endless Invader</strong> began their assault, seeking to consume this alluring source of power. <br>Whether by sheer will or destiny, the planet responded by birthing two guardians from its core: <strong>Cletinera</strong> and <strong>Castlan</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of the female guardian, <strong>Cletinera</strong>, destroying visible enemy units to stop the invasion. <br>As time passes, enemies will grow stronger and appear in greater numbers. To resist them, you'll need to absorb as many <strong>Terravital Spheres</strong> as possible from defeated foes to continue growing stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/0d7ad47f45193e2142467bcbc3ee353a.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/0d7ad47f45193e2142467bcbc3ee353a.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the upgrade system to enhance your abilities in various fields.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more enemies you defeat, the stronger and tougher you become! <br>Absorb <strong>Terravital Spheres</strong> dropped by enemies to level up, and open the <strong>Upgrader</strong> to strengthen your capabilities. <br>Unleash powerful, flashy attacks, gain unmatched speed, or increase your planet's durability. Carve out your own upgrade path and dominate the game your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/54077d3b086a539d4c6012314ca6ee6e.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/54077d3b086a539d4c6012314ca6ee6e.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the most of three distinct weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just repetitive single-attack combat! <br>You'll be switching between three weapons with completely different attack styles\u2014<strong>Blaster</strong>, <strong>Lance</strong>, and <strong>Shield</strong>. <br>By investing in weapon upgrades, you\u2019ll unlock unique special attacks and weapon-switch abilities that make your playstyle even more dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/2fa2b73f3fcd13822de7c14cfccb9ed1.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/2fa2b73f3fcd13822de7c14cfccb9ed1.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respond to increasingly powerful enemies with strategic decisions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by the simple appearance of early-stage enemies! <br>Before you know it, you'll be overwhelmed by enemies that are too strong and too numerous to handle. <br>Special units that appear mid-stage with flashy entrances will have you sweating. <br>If it seems impossible to defeat them all, consider your options\u2014<strong>hint: pay attention to their colors!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/8aa137118db727084648551a7b8d1c32.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/8aa137118db727084648551a7b8d1c32.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rely on allies and lucky bonuses for a more stable fight.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this fight! <br>Trust in <strong>Castlan</strong>, the male guardian who roams beneath your feet. <br>He'll attack enemies on your behalf and can even protect you with a temporary shield. <br>Also, once in a while, <strong>luck</strong> will be on your side\u2014dropping powerful items that can turn the tide and help you survive even the most dangerous moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/e361a3bbeffc0f4c479d2677bc66d451.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/e361a3bbeffc0f4c479d2677bc66d451.webp?t=1753213229\" class=\"bb_img\" width=480 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The key is to keep the planet alive until the end.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy forces aren't truly infinite! <br>If you resist to the very end, they will eventually exhaust their troops while your planet still stands. <br>At last, they will summon their <strong>final unit</strong>. <br>Defeat this ultimate threat, and <strong>victory will be yours</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/96bffc7fc6460414b8ac913ae89d54db.poster.avif?t=1753213229\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/96bffc7fc6460414b8ac913ae89d54db.webm?t=1753213229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692930/extras/96bffc7fc6460414b8ac913ae89d54db.mp4?t=1753213229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only you can change the fate of the remote planet Aevinculum.</strong> <br><strong>Now, head out into the universe of the Guardians!</strong></p>",
